This plugin combines ideas and values from two MIT-licensed upstream
projects. No upstream file is vendored verbatim; the files below were
written for this plugin and carry upstream design values, structure,
and rules, restated in this repository's own words.

Upstream 1: Cocoon-AI/architecture-diagram-generator
  https://github.com/Cocoon-AI/architecture-diagram-generator
  commit 4b9087d55268c79a935105439dbcd37b630fc3f3 at time of adaptation
  MIT License, Copyright (c) 2025 Cocoon AI

Upstream 2: tt-a1i/archify (itself based on upstream 1)
  https://github.com/tt-a1i/archify
  commit 1bb61c69538e37d80793b25843f620e55469f3a2 at time of adaptation
  MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 tt-a1i (Archify), Copyright (c) 2025 Cocoon AI

Per-file mapping:

  - skills/creating-diagrams/references/template.html
      Page layout (header, diagram card, summary cards, footer), the
      opaque mask technique, grid pattern, arrow marker geometry, and
      SVG text sizes follow upstream 1's resources/template.html. The
      semantic class vocabulary (c-*, a-*, t-*), the CSS custom property
      names (--bg, --mask, --<type>-fill, --<type>-stroke), and the
      [data-theme] light/dark switch follow upstream 2's
      archify/assets/template.html. The export code, per-color markers,
      color-mix() fills, and the THEME block are original.
  - themes/classic/theme.css
      Dark stroke and neutral values from upstream 1's SKILL.md palette;
      light values from upstream 2's classic light palette, with the
      light --arrow darkened from #94a3b8 to #64748b to meet the 3:1
      contrast floor.
  - skills/creating-diagrams/references/diagram-types.md
      The five diagram types, the seven component types, and the
      lifecycle state-to-color mapping follow upstream 2's SKILL.md and
      authoring contract; boundary styles (region, security group) follow
      upstream 1's SKILL.md.
  - skills/creating-diagrams/references/layout-and-review.md
      The 40px minimum gap and legend-outside-boundaries rule follow
      upstream 1's SKILL.md. The label width estimate, segment length
      minimums, main-path rule, review checks, and repair order are
      adapted from upstream 2's SKILL.md and
      references/authoring-contract.md, reworked from a CLI validator
      into a manual screenshot review.

Original work under this repository's MIT license: SKILL.md,
references/theming.md, themes/README.md, README.md, both plugin
manifests, and every part of the files above not attributed here.

Not carried over from upstream 2: its Node CLI, JSON schemas,
renderers, viewer runtime, embedded JetBrains Mono font (OFL 1.1), and
brand-mark icons (Simple Icons with mixed per-mark licenses). None of
those bytes ship in this plugin.

No em-dash or en-dash substitution clause applies: no upstream text
was copied verbatim.
